# The four-computer start-up to OPS 201, then the TIME display (SPEC 2) on
# CRT1, held for three minutes: MTU ACCUM 1, 2 and 3 should track GPC time
# and carry no down arrow (ledger #210, #213).  Run with
# NSTS_ANNOUNCE_ROWS=all and read the frames with screenwatch.py.
+0     script 4gpc-startup.script
+30    keys KB1 SPEC 2 PRO
+180   subtitle
